Seed: DateRange.IsoWeek(weekYear, week) trusts ISOWeek.ToDateTime with the week number, which reads week 53 of a 52-week year as week 1 of the next
Oracles: CalendarRangeParityTests
Fails: IsoWeek(y, 53) for every 52-week year y returns the first week of y + 1 instead of throwing, where LocalDateRange throws
History: found while writing the calendar factories for 10.0.0, before they shipped

